  respectively. Proceeds will primarily be used to repay $600M of 2.95% Fir
 st and Refunding Mortgage Bonds due 2026\, repay a portion of a $1.5B vari
 able rate term loan maturing March 2027\, pay down intercompany short-term
  debt\, and for general corporate purposes.
